LtT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two lost souls visiting Tokyo -- the young, neglected wife of a photographer and a washed-up movie star shooting a TV commercial -- find an odd solace and pensive freedom to be real in each other's company, away from their lives in America.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":634,\"title\":\"Bridget Jones's Diary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/olMTi7uCaec9Yr3Ar07D2SIja1G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9rSpxsMhG1FnFtUDdvSAXdtLtb3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year's resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6964,\"title\":\"Something's Gotta Give\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cpdqe0SpiHzzbOLq9GDUUlZdSl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xTQXtSQQZY5ZbJ1GxEcSCRP4aWV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When perpetually single, aging music industry exec Harry Sanborn, and his latest trophy girlfriend, Marin, arrive at her mother's beach house in the Hamptons, they find that her mother, playwright Erica Barry, also plans to stay for the weekend. Erica is scandalized by the relationship and Harry's sexist ways. But when Harry has a heart attack while there, and the doctor prescribes bedrest, his only option is to stay at the Barry home. Left in the care of Erica and his doctor, a love triangle starts to take shape.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10735,\"title\":\"What a Girl Wants\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gGpMruX59KWNuAXgHpiAm8hiChw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bZwUUgz0pgl1cEjcvpDSsBfYvzK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"American Daphne Reynolds heads to Europe in search of the father she's never met. But instead of finding a British version of her boho mother, she learns the love of her mom's life is an uptight politician. The only problem now is that her long-lost father is engaged to a fiercely territorial social climber with a daughter who makes Daphne's life miserable.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":455,\"title\":\"Bend It Like Beckham\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2dzSBmFWWqt8NbnubJKIWU21Y86.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vUe5v3l6ul7coxMv2oLwINeVgFi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jess Bhamra, the daughter of a strict Indian couple in London, is not permitted to play organized soccer, even though she is 18. When Jess is playing for fun one day, her impressive skills are seen by Jules Paxton, who then convinces Jess to play for her semi-pro team. Jess uses elaborate excuses to hide her matches from her family while also dealing with her romantic feelings for her coach, Joe.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20770,\"title\":\"But I'm a Cheerleader\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/88hFUrbqSdcSx7P1nDXVRXpkMoh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f4ZgIaMpOWd6rewhCfoIIMqWquh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn't like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she's pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to \\\"sexual redirection\\\" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21542,\"title\":\"Love Don't Co$t a Thing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/88zspc72LIkfiuMnGpHnsWCuqEH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bYk4H2MSvNWckhrYhZNQHe8v90o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A high school outcast pays a cheerleader to pose as his girlfriend so he can be considered cool.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12435,\"title\":\"The Nanny Diaries\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8hX6rcxnCidaqegPCyeFm9PODBn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t5gmdPLPHSaEuGpSwxiH5wco0XS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A college graduate goes to work as a nanny for a rich New York family. Ensconced in their home, she has to juggle their dysfunction, a new romance, and the spoiled brat in her charge.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":103332,\"title\":\"Ruby Sparks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zELurt0GVRkR5X5ymuk7KXUxhC8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4EqTcyWfO807ihMzGHequR7x1Co.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Calvin is a young novelist who achieved phenomenal success early in his career but is now struggling with his writing – as well as his romantic life. Finally, he makes a breakthrough and creates a character named Ruby who inspires him. When Calvin finds Ruby, in the flesh, sitting on his couch about a week later, he is completely flabbergasted that his words have turned into a living, breathing person.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43923,\"title\":\"It's Kind of a Funny Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hQE4q8Szeaae4davgB7o8MTLmwr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7gkk5K0NnVSqZ0Qr4zkNskH9AC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A clinically depressed teenager gets a new start after he checks himself into an adult psychiatric ward.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5047,\"title\":\"Les petites couleurs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/auXnQ7VXc4kUcsTX1XMkt6D8QoJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1FOSaFZ0X6rQDTfiE4CTFcQjmYr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Swiss drama in the form of a road movie starring Bernadette Lafont. Hairdresser Christelle is harassed daily by her chauvinistic husband until she can no longer stand it and flees. She then meets the strong landlady Mona and learns to see her life from a different perspective.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"h7AnKygdGrI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"VtwEwgU6cjo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"19IA0VQ0y3I\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}